id: king-shell
name: King
order: 1
optionOf: difference-in-shell
optionEffect: 2
# Pieces of the Hive's King chosen: this one.
follows: king
# On the Insect Shell, in no Quality Slot (racial.mjs platingQuality).
platingQuality: leaders-insignia
# "increase your Apparel Bonus by 1(bT) while you have an adjacent Ally" - its Apparel Bonus (gear.mjs platingBonusPerBaseTier).
platingBonusPerBaseTier: 1
platingBonusWhile: allyBeside
description: >
  Your Insect Shell gains the Leader’s Insignia Apparel Quality without occupying any Quality Slots. Additionally, increase your Apparel Bonus by 1(bT) while you have an adjacent Ally.
text: >
  King [Passive]: Your Insect Shell gains the Leader’s Insignia Apparel Quality without occupying any Quality Slots. Additionally, increase your Apparel Bonus by 1(bT) while you have an adjacent Ally.

